# Use in IntelliJ HTTP Client or VS Code REST Client.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Create or merge
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ducks
Content-Type: application/json

{"color":"Red","size":"Large","price":10.00,"quantity":1000}

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ducks

### Read for edit (replace ID with returned warehouse ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ducks/1

### Edit
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ducks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":10.00,"quantity":1000}

### Quote
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/store/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"color":"Red","size":"Large","quantity":100,"destinationCountry":"USA","shippingMode":"Land"}

### Invalid order (must reject a client price)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/store/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"color":"Red","size":"Large","quantity":100,"destinationCountry":"USA","shippingMode":"Land","price":1}

### Logical delete (run after the quote example)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/ducks/1
